# The pause menu's "Jump to" (src/game/jumps.h): from the opening (not on foot yet) START pauses,
# L six times to "Jump to", R jumps to the corridor's start (booting on foot first: a moment's
# freeze), START plays on there. Then each place in turn: START, R, START, a shot of the menu and of
# the place. At the CD hub, stood a while with its watchdog round the lift: a hub's safe, so its
# beam never turns red and the debug line's wd stays P (game/city.h: city_on_hub)
wait_boot
press start
wait 0.6
press l 6
press r
wait 2.0
shot jp_00_menu_start
press start
wait 1.5
shot jp_01_start
press start
wait 0.6
press r
wait 0.6
shot jp_02_menu_yard
press start
wait 1.5
shot jp_03_yard
press start
wait 0.6
press r
press start
wait 1.5
shot jp_04_stairs
press start
wait 0.6
press r
press start
wait 1.5
shot jp_05_entry
press start
wait 0.6
press r
press start
wait 1.5
shot jp_06_drone_1
press start
wait 0.6
press r
press start
wait 1.5
shot jp_07_drone_2
press start
wait 0.6
press r
